## 9. Instant Interact

Makes interaction prompts (e.g., looting) complete instantly. Hooks the game's `GetInteractPromptData`.

```lua
local ReplicatedFirst = game:GetService("ReplicatedFirst")

local instantInteractEnabled = false

task.spawn(function()
    local Framework = require(ReplicatedFirst:WaitForChild("Framework"))
    Framework:WaitForLoaded()

    local Interactables = Framework.Classes.Interactables
    local originalGetInteractPromptData = Interactables.GetInteractPromptData

    Interactables.GetInteractPromptData = function(...)
        local data = originalGetInteractPromptData(...)
        if instantInteractEnabled and data.Actions and data.Actions[1] then
            data.Actions[1].Time = 0
        end
        return data
    end
end)

-- Toggle instantInteractEnabled = true/false
```

