## 10. Container Persistence

Prevents the game from closing containers when you walk away (blocks the "Inventory Closed" network event).

```lua
local ReplicatedFirst = game:GetService("ReplicatedFirst")

local containerPersistenceEnabled = false

task.spawn(function()
    local Framework = require(ReplicatedFirst:WaitForChild("Framework"))
    Framework:WaitForLoaded()

    local Network = Framework.Libraries.Network
    local originalSend = Network.Send

    local function newSend(self, eventName, ...)
        if eventName == "Inventory Closed" and containerPersistenceEnabled then
            return  -- swallow the event
        end
        return originalSend(self, eventName, ...)
    end

    Network.Send = newSend
end)

-- Toggle containerPersistenceEnabled = true/false
```

